 "A life returns every 30 minutes, counted from real time, so it keeps refilling while the game is closed. If you change your device’s clock backwards, the game ignores it and you may wait longer. Keep **Settings › General › Date & Time › Set Automatically** on. Tap the heart on the Journey to see when the next life comes.": "help:troubleshooting",
