 "Name the technology and its settings: VoiceOver (with your speech rate or Braille display if relevant), Voice Control, Switch Control (auto or manual scanning), Zoom, Larger Text size.": "help:reporting-bugs",
 "Never post a password, a sign-in code, a purchase receipt or anything that identifies you. Crop account details out of screenshots.": "help:using-the-community",
 "Nothing that identifies you is sent: no name, no Game Center or iCloud identity, no advertising identifier. iOS does not let apps detect **Voice Control** or **Zoom**, so tick those yourself if you use them.": "help:reporting-bugs",
 "Only a video watched to the end pays its reward.": "help:troubleshooting",
 "Open OutBrick and give it a minute online: progress is fetched and merged when the game starts.": "help:troubleshooting",
 "Open OutBrick once so it can share your latest progress with its widgets. If a widget still looks wrong, remove it and add it again. Widgets refresh on a schedule set by iOS, so a few minutes’ delay is normal.": "help:troubleshooting",
 "OutBrick sends at most one notification every 20 hours, never between 22:00 and 09:00, so quiet days are normal.": "help:troubleshooting",
 "Post it in [Accessibility](/community/c/accessibility) if you prefer: the team reads it most closely.": "help:reporting-bugs",
 "Quick fixes for missing progress, purchases that did not arrive, lives that seem stuck, no sound, missing notifications, widgets, videos that will not load and VoiceOver focus problems.": "help:troubleshooting",
